Prabha Society, Green Park, Ankleshwar Society, Chandan Society, Polan Bazar, Signal Falia, Jahurpura.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-blue-800 border-b pb-4\">Industrial GIDC Zones</h3>\r\n<div class=\"h-64 overflow-y-auto text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-600 pr-4 space-y-2\">Godhra GIDC (Bamroli), Shera Industrial Belt, Godhra-Lunayada Highway Industrial Corridor, Kakanpur Industrial Area.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- FAQ SECTION - 10 QUESTIONS -->\r\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 italic text-gray-900\">10 Critical AC Installation FAQs for Godhra</h2>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4\"><!-- FAQ 1 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\" open=\"\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800 text-sm md:text-base\">Is vacuuming mandatory during installation in Godhra? <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Absolutely. Without 500-micron vacuuming, moisture remains in the pipes, leading to acid formation and eventual compressor failure. Every <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/ac-service-godhra\">Godhra AC service</a> we perform includes this mandatory technical step.</p>\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 2 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800\">How long does professional installation take? <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">A professional split AC setup in Godhra typically takes 2.5 to 3 hours, ensuring all safety checks and vacuuming are completed correctly.</p>\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 3 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800\">Do you provide VRF installation for multi-floor buildings? <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Yes, we specialize in <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-godhra\">Central AC installations</a> for corporate and commercial offices in Godhra.</p>\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 4 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800\">What is the ideal mounting height for the indoor unit? <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Ideally, 7.5 to 8 feet from the floor to allow for proper airflow and ease of future <a class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold underline\" href=\"/ac-repair-godhra\">repairs</a>.</p>\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 5 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800\">Do you offer a workmanship warranty? <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Yes, Atlas Aircon provides a 30-day installation guarantee for every job in Godhra. If any vibration or leak occurs, we fix it for free.</p>\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 6 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800\">Can I reuse my old copper pipes for an inverter AC? <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">We strongly advise new <a class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/copper-pipe/\">copper piping</a> to avoid residue contamination from older units using R22 gas.</p>\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 7 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800\">Is an MS stand necessary for the outdoor unit? <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Yes. A heavy-duty <a class=\"text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline\" href=\"/outdoor-stand/\">outdoor stand</a> is essential for safety, stability, and to reduce vibration noise.</p>\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 8 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800\">Do you repair commercial deep freezers? <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Yes, our Godhra team handles <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-godhra\">deep freezer repair</a> and industrial <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/chiller-repair-services-godhra\">chiller maintenance</a>.</p>\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 9 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800\">What electrical wiring do I need? <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">A 4.0 sq mm <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/copper-wire/\">multi-strand wire</a> and a dedicated 16A MCB are recommended for modern 5-star ACs.</p>\r\n</details><!-- FAQ 10 --><details class=\"group border rounded-2xl p-6 hover:bg-gray-50 transition-all\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-bold cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center list-none text-gray-800\">How often should AHUs be serviced in factories? <span class=\"text-blue-600 font-light text-2xl group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform\">+</span></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-sm\">Industrial <a class=\"text-blue-600 hover:underline\" href=\"/air-handling-unit-services-godhra\">AHU systems</a> in Godhra GIDC should have filters cleaned monthly and full service every 3-4 months.</p>\r\n</details></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- FINAL CTA -->\r\n<section class=\"py-24 px-4 hero-gradient text-white text-center\">\r\n<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6\">Ready for 10/10 Cooling in Godhra?</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-blue-100 text-lg mb-10\">Professional technical installation for your home or office is just a click away. Experience the Atlas Aircon difference.</p>\r\n<a class=\"inline-block bg-white text-blue-900 px-12 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xl hover:bg-blue-50 transform hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-2xl\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\"> <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt mr-2\"></i> Book Godhra Installation Now </a></div>\r\n</section>",
